WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:36.850
Core 3 is the colony in Side 3
where Haman currently is.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:40.650
We snuck into a mine
in order to infiltrate it.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.400
But we ran into Chara,
and then Ple-Two,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.070
along with some laborers who
are rebelling against Haman.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:49.200
So we never actually
made it into Core 3.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:54.120
But now that the mining asteroid
Cicero has docked with it,

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.200
is Haman calling to me?

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:02.070
THE GIRL FROM CORE 3

00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:02.070
(Part 2)

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.970
Core 3.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:10.260
The central colony
in Side 3's airspace.

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:14.350
The Earth Federation government
has given this colony to Haman.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:23.590
The hatch is opening!

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:27.490
Is that clear? The rebels
and the Gundam Team...

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:29.280
are hiding here in Cicero!

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.620
I want every last one of
them dragged out of here!

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.240
Go!

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:38.370
Hey! Where's the
rebel hideout?

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:39.750
I don't know!

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:42.670
Tell me and I'll get you
out of this forced labor.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:45.380
- You wanna go home, right?
- C-Come on!

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:49.930
They ran?!

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.800
Aren't there any clues?!

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:54.220
- That was close.
- This way!

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.830
What?!

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.250
Break the door down!

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.350
You insolent...!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.460
Don't you ruffians know this is
the room of Princess Mineva Zabi?!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.840
Mineva... Zabi.

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:31.170
What?!

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.260
Any resistance,
and we shoot!

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.470
All right!

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:38.270
Princess Mineva Zabi.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.600
Who are you?

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:42.600
Strange.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.940
Any more funny business,
and we'll shoot you dead!

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:49.070
Forgive the intrusion.

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:52.370
Failures like this won't be
forgiven a second time.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.570
Yes.

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.540
Where's Mary's little lamb?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.660
Already eaten.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:02.540
Mr. Roy, you're okay!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.960
Naturally.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:04.750
Mr. Roy!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:05.880
Do you know the situation?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:10.920
Yeah. We have Zeon forces from
airlocks 1 and 2 up to tunnel 13.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:12.470
What about sub-airlock 4?

00:04:12.470 --> 00:04:14.340
That one's okay.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:16.050
And the Zeta and Double Zeta?

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.890
Yeah. We're still able to retake Cicero.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.480
Mr. Roy, do you know
where Haman is?

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.980
At the moment...

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.170
they've confiscated a
civilian villa in the hills.

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.060
What's the plan?

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.070
Fire the Nahel Argama's high mega cannon
at Haman, wherever she is!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.570
That's insane!

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.950
Core 3 has five million inhabitants!

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:38.050
Along with Elle, Roux, and Rutina.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.160
I know!

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.790
There's a way we can use the
Nahel Argama's high mega cannon!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.680
Glemy has spoken to me of you.
Raise your head, Ple-Two.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.180
Yes, my lady.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.480
Were you and Elpeo Ple twin sisters?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:10.770
I don't know.
I never knew any "Elpeo Ple."

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:14.070
Is that what Glemy taught you?

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:16.660
I learned that much
on my own.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.450
I see.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:20.620
If you believe that,
so much the better.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.950
This pressure is incredible.
I can't do it here.

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:27.960
Carry on. You are ordered to
suppress the Cicero rebels.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.630
Yes, my lady!

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.220
Well done, Chara.

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:37.760
Yes, my lady!

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.220
Nee, Lance?

00:05:39.220 --> 00:05:40.890
My lady!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.760
Damn you, Glemy.

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:45.850
Having a Cyber-Newtype
get close to me!

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:51.520
Will it be safe to blow out the docking
section between Cicero and Core 3?

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.440
It'll be fine.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:57.000
It won't cause any harm to
the people in Core 3 or Cicero.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:00.370
It's not that I don't
trust you guys, but...

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:02.620
- See you, Judau!
- I'm counting on you, Iino!

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:06.910
You've started feeling
worried about Rutina.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:11.540
I can't stop worrying
about Elle and Roux.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.050
I-I'm sorry to be such
an irresponsible father.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:17.010
Anyway, you've gotta drive the
Zeon soldiers out of Cicero...

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:19.180
before the Nahel
Argama gets here!

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:25.930
Okay, now!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.890
Let's do it, Judau! Iino!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:43.660
Whoa, here they come!
A whole swarm of them!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.120
Okay! Time to do it!

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.340
- Here I go, Judau!
- Okay, do it!

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.970
A lot can happen on the
way to the Nahel Argama.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.220
Same for you!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.940
Whoa! Nearly got me!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.690
You'll pay for this!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.280
I'm doing almost
as good as Judau!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:33.120
From here, it's just a quick
flight to the Nahel Argama!

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.210
Yikes! I'm at my limit!

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.420
That asteroid! Go!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:51.770
It worked!

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:54.440
I wonder if things went
well for Judau and Iino, too.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:06.240
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:07.830
I'm telling you it's not.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:11.160
This is just too thin...
Roux, don't you have anything?

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:13.870
Even if you open it,
there's a guard outside.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:17.750
I was thinking my natural
charm could lead to something.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:19.090
What are you doing?!

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:21.360
Um, just a little exercise!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.760
So much for that!

00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.950
Rutina Revin, out!

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.180
We won't let you take her!

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:32.390
What are you going to do?!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.690
Defy me, and the next
shot hits you for real.

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.060
Come on!

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:39.860
Wait. I'll go.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:40.820
Rutina!

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.570
- Right, come here.
- Rutina!

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:45.070
I'll be okay.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.990
Rutina!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.040
Stop.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.960
What are we doing here?

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:59.090
If you stay, you'll die.
Now run!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.170
Why just me?

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:04.470
Do you have any siblings?

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:07.680
None. I just have my father.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:08.680
I see.

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.140
If you're sparing me,
then spare Elle and Roux, as well!

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.560
Don't think of other people!

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:16.310
If you don't want to die,
get as far from here as you can!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.190
Then why are you doing this?!

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.070
That girl must be in
league with Ple-Two.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:26.490
Meaning she works for Glemy.

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:29.490
Ple-Two is--

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:32.370
Forget her.
That girl interests me more.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.080
- But--
- No back talk!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.960
I'm your commander!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.000
C-Commander! The girl!

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.040
What?

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:40.750
She's headed back
the way she came.

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:45.020
See! Just as I suspected!
Let's go! Nee! Lance!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.880
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:49.640
I managed to sneak in
this far, but...

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.560
ls that the villa
Mr. Roy mentioned?

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:56.480
Now, how do I find
Rutina and the others?

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:57.770
Rutina!

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.100
Rutina!

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.020
Judau!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.440
Rutina, where're Elle and Roux?

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.780
Locked up in the basement
of that house over there!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.370
I see. But why are you...?

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.660
A girl named
Ple-Two saved me.

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.930
Ple-Two did? Why?

00:10:14.930 --> 00:10:16.410
l don't know.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.960
But I don't want to be
the only one saved,

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.380
so I headed back!

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.990
She just let you go?

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:25.170
Now it's Judau Ashta!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.220
Could it be that the Gundam
Team and the Cicero rebels...

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:31.970
are both being controlled by
Glemy Toto behind the scenes?

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:35.770
- That's kind of--
- That's it! It must be it!

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.930
M-Mistress Chara!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.430
Oh, no you don't!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:43.090
Freeze!

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.520
Chara?

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:47.190
Drop your gun!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.240
We said freeze!

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.320
Chara, snap out of it!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.830
Shut up!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.580
The Qubeley!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.460
That's why I told you
to watch out for Ple-Two!

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:02.670
Qubeley! Where are you going?

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:05.210
We won't allow you to
act out of line!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.430
We'll intercept her
in our mobile suits!

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:12.470
Right!

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:14.720
- Chara!
- Mr. Judau!

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:19.230
Haman Karn, prepare to die!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:24.560
Somebody!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.270
Are you all right?!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.570
At last, she shows
her true colors!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.820
That explains the pressure
I sensed before.

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:32.990
Take Princess Mineva
to someplace safe!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.660
Right!

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.580
It's Glemy!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.490
Glemy launched a
surprise attack on Axis...

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:41.540
instead of suppressing the
Nahel Argama, as ordered!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:43.920
Glemy? Axis?

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:53.260
Damn him... he just couldn't wait,
so he jumped at the chance.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:55.180
Axis is falling?

00:11:55.180 --> 00:11:58.180
Yes! They say
it's a matter of time.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.970
Assemble all forces in the port!

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.270
Yes, my lady!

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:23.080
Is this all you are,
Haman Karn?!

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:27.170
Have you nothing
to answer my powers?

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.380
Don't make me laugh!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:34.260
You think we'll let you
go on making fools of us?!

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:38.180
To hell with some jumped-up
woman who's all talk!

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:47.190
Every single thing
you do is idiotic!

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:52.110
Even the Qubeley will be easily beaten
by a full barrage from the Geymalk!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.990
Mistress Chara, please don't!
You'll damage Core 3!

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:59.530
Lady Haman and Princess Mineva
are still in the mansion!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.870
What?!

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:04.580
Are you saying I can't
show her the Geymalk's abilities?!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:10.410
Didn't I tell you? You never
think about anything you do!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.750
Hold your tongue!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.670
You belittle the royal
guard at your own peril!

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.190
A mobile suit battle,
inside the colony?

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.900
Maybe Judau's come!

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.400
Isn't this a little overboard,
even for him?

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:40.070
I know I should hold back because
Lady Haman is near, but I can't take it!

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:52.380
No good!
We can't get through here!

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.510
That way!

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:55.880
Damn you, Glemy.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:14:00.340
Do you think I never imagined
that this day would come?

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.390
You don't know the reason?
Why not?!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:09.560
What's happening?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.690
The Qubeley seems to be
attacking Lady Haman!

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.610
What?!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.490
What the...?!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:22.120
Go! Drive the Zeon
soldiers from Cicero!

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:24.330
Shoot! Shoot them!

00:14:29.310 --> 00:14:31.130
- This way.
- Right.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.790
Somebody, open the door!

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.300
Let us out!

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:37.090
I don't want to die here!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:38.050
Elle! Roux!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.590
The voice of God!

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.590
Miss Roux! Miss Elle!
Are you okay?

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.470
Stand back!
I'll shoot the lock!

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.100
Do it!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.810
Judau! I knew
you'd come save us!

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:51.230
What are you doing?!
Move it!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:51.940
Gotcha!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:54.730
Judau! We were having a
really touching reunion there!

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.480
Sorry!

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:57.780
Forget it!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:02.110
What?

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.740
Haman Karn!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.830
Haman!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:09.290
You? Now I see.

00:15:09.290 --> 00:15:12.760
You created a barrier
within this mansion?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.710
You mean you were
feeling the strain?

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:17.630
I don't know if it's your mental strength
or something else,

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:21.090
but if not for that,
we wouldn't have been so slow...

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:23.480
in dealing with
the Qubeley.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.930
Now, will you step
aside please, Newtype?

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.980
NO!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:34.940
Judau!

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.030
How dare you, Ple-Two!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:46.240
Lady Haman! Princess Mineva!
Why, you...!

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.580
Mistress Chara!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:51.580
Lady Haman and Princess Mineva
are inside! Get them!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.330
What are you playing at?!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.250
I-I didn't intend it!
It just happened!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:01.340
Didn't I tell you?
You and I are of a kind.

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:02.840
We call to each other.

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:03.930
You're wrong!

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:05.050
Silence, child!

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:07.850
Judau just didn't want
a child to get killed!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.850
You pigheaded...!

00:16:10.100 --> 00:16:13.190
Lady Haman.
Get aboard, quickly!

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:16.440
Lance? Good work!
Get back!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.530
I'll let you go for now.

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:23.450
Damn you, Haman!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.570
Bring them to the
Sadalahn in the port!

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:27.490
Right!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:33.580
Haman's leaving?
Dammit, Chara!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:46.260
Not far now!
Hang in there! There it is!

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.010
Isn't that a linear car station?

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.010
We can't escape by linear car!

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:52.480
They won't be running
during an emergency!

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.310
It'll be okay!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.770
- It's pitch black!
- Never mind that!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.650
Look.

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:02.440
A Core Fighter!

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:09.870
I'm here, ready for a
dramatic showdown,

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.240
and nobody's showing up!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.870
Where did all those
mobile suits go?

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.120
Look, over there!

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:16.620
Right on time!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.250
It's Beecha and Mondo!

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.300
Awesome!

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:29.100
Beecha, how are
things at Cicero?

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:31.640
We pushed back the Zeon soldiers
into the docking bay.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:33.430
Now we just have to
wait for the Nahel Argama!

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:35.640
Mondo, disconnect
the linear car.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:38.270
I'm on it! Did anything
happen in there?

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:40.270
All kinds of stuff.

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:48.030
You annoying worms!
That's...!

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.040
To think we'd meet
in a place like this!

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:55.080
Ple-Two... Mondo, hurry!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:55.870
It's off!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.080
Beecha! Switch me
into the Double Zeta!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.130
Gotcha!

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.850
I see! I see! So that's
how you always play!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:16.770
Even with so few funnels...

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.150
I...!

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:25.740
What are you doing?!
Do you want me to kill you?!

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.360
Stop acting so tough!

00:18:29.360 --> 00:18:31.570
Why did you flinch just now?

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:34.080
Why did you
save Rutina, Ple-Two?!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:38.500
What are you saying?
Why bring that up now?

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.170
I know why, Ple-Two.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:43.170
Because you regret killing Ple.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:46.870
So you tried to make up
for it by saving Rutina!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.590
Stop jumping to conclusions!

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:51.510
Then why did you
only save Rutina?!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.560
Th-That's...

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.060
Because she reminds you of Ple!

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:59.310
No... Rutina reminds you
of yourself, doesn't she?!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:02.690
No... you're wrong...

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.780
You tricked me!
That was a dirty tactic, Judau Ashta!

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:09.860
I wasn't trying to!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:13.360
Ple-Two, just face your own
heart and the pain will go away!

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:15.620
I feel no pain!

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:23.040
He dodged an all-range attack?!

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:28.390
Just be honest with yourself!
You aren't really that kind of girl!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.800
You know nothing about me!

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:43.980
Target acquired.
Ready the high mega cannon!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.320
Target scope, open!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.740
It's time. Fall back!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.000
Right!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.460
Uh-oh, it's time for the
high mega cannon to be fired!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:09.050
Ple-Two!
Get out of this airspace!

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:10.880
Trying to trick me again?!

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.930
No! You're in danger!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.390
Energy at critical!
Firing high mega cannon!

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:19.890
High mega cannon, fire!

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:46.040
What's that tremor?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.460
Cicero's docking bay has been severed
by a powerful mega particle cannon!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.170
The Nahel Argama?

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:53.920
Lady Haman.

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:56.680
Allow me to sortie
in the Geymalk.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:59.760
I wish to redeem myself
for letting Ple-Two get away!

00:20:59.760 --> 00:21:01.140
Leave them be.

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.430
We can afford to lose
one mining asteroid.

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.190
Dealing with Glemy
is our priority now.

00:21:06.190 --> 00:21:07.400
B-But...!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:11.690
Chara Soon, I'm leaving
this fleet in your hands.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:14.520
Now show me you can
crush Glemy's rebellion!

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:15.490
Yes, my lady!

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.250
Father!

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.750
Rutina! You're all right!

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:33.590
Forgive me,
for causing you such grief.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:35.260
I'm a terrible father.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:38.010
No, that's not true.

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:40.260
You were able to save
everyone this way.

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:41.850
You're a great father!

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:46.560
No, Cicero owes its freedom
to Judau and his friends.

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:48.560
I don't know how
we can ever thank you.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.860
All we did was help a little.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:53.530
You and the others would've
made this happen anyway.

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:55.030
Thank you.

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:59.450
Luckily, Cicero has enough air and
food to hold out for a while.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:01.740
We'll migrate to another colony.

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:05.620
Good idea.
Rutina, take care of your dad.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:11.710
Judau, that girl Ple-Two...
she isn't a bad person.

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:15.590
Yeah. I think I know
that, Rutina.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:49.870
As Glemy's and Chara's fleets began
to clash, we saw an opportunity.

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:53.460
So I infiltrated Core 3 to take
Mineva Zabi hostage.

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.510
But that was just
me being big-headed.

00:23:56.510 --> 00:24:00.130
Meanwhile, the Nahel
Argama fell into danger.

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:04.100
And the one who saved the Argama
by becoming its shield was...!

00:24:04.100 --> 00:24:07.730
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Emary's Glory."

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
EMARY'S GLORY

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:09.890
You can't handle it!
